{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-6","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["event-rogue-6"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810401-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-6","missionId":"event-rogue-6","mission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","scene":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"컴컴한 방안의 텔레비전에서 스타피스 컴퍼니 전통프로젝트부에서 제작한 홈쇼핑 채널이 방송되고 있다","talkId":403810401,"textHash":"15821921352441122544","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:6/talk-403810401","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"6a342c3361d31189","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810402-line"],"bwikiPage":"电视购物频道","bwikiRevision":95721,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8736","bwikiMission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810402-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-6","missionId":"event-rogue-6","mission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","scene":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「안녕하세요. 핫나이트 시티 홈쇼핑 채널입니다. 방송을 시작하기 전에 먼저 불확정 상자에 대한 시청자 여러분의 불만사항에 답변드리겠습니다. 다들 아시겠지만 불확정 상자가 정확한 측정이 가능하다면 확정 상자라고 부르는 게 맞겠지요……. 치익……」","talkId":403810402,"textHash":"14565776995927052886","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:6/talk-403810402","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"6a342c3361d31189","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810403-line"],"bwikiPage":"电视购物频道","bwikiRevision":95721,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8736","bwikiMission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810403-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-6","missionId":"event-rogue-6","mission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","scene":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"오래된 텔레비전의 화면이 하얗게 변하더니 신호가 점점 약해진다. 얼마 지나지 않아 아무런 소리도 들을 수 없게 된다","talkId":403810403,"textHash":"7394608614815446135","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:6/talk-403810403","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"6a342c3361d31189","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"电视购物频道","bwikiRevision":95721,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8736","bwikiMission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810408-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-6","missionId":"event-rogue-6","mission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","scene":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「자, 이제 스타피스 컴퍼니에서 준비한 은하를 넘나드는 상품을 소개해 드리겠습니다」","talkId":403810408,"textHash":"6517602036852440855","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:6/talk-403810408","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"ea6e5e858273cb54","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810409-line"],"bwikiPage":"电视购物频道","bwikiRevision":95721,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8736","bwikiMission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810409-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-6","missionId":"event-rogue-6","mission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","scene":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「유통기한이 지난 도넛 한 세트입니다. 핫나이트 시티는 이미 제IV기원에 접어들어 음식의 유통 기한은 영원하다고 볼 수 있죠. 시민들은 유통기한이 지난 음식은 대체 어떤 맛일지 매우 궁금해하고 있습니다」","talkId":403810409,"textHash":"17732242390227266342","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:6/talk-403810409","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"ea6e5e858273cb54","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810410-line"],"bwikiPage":"电视购物频道","bwikiRevision":95721,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8736","bwikiMission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810410-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-6","missionId":"event-rogue-6","mission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","scene":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「생일 축하 노래를 불러주는 연꽃입니다. 꿈속에 수없이 등장했던 우리 모두의 어린 시절 추억이죠」","talkId":403810410,"textHash":"15214550352783559737","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:6/talk-403810410","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"ea6e5e858273cb54","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810411-line"],"bwikiPage":"电视购物频道","bwikiRevision":95721,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8736","bwikiMission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810411-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-6","missionId":"event-rogue-6","mission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","scene":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「기계 상자입니다. 200년 동안이나 팔리지 않은 상품으로 보이는군요」","talkId":403810411,"textHash":"13464104986967078811","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:6/talk-403810411","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"ea6e5e858273cb54","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810412-line"],"bwikiPage":"电视购物频道","bwikiRevision":95721,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8736","bwikiMission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810412-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-6","missionId":"event-rogue-6","mission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","scene":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"깊은 생각에 빠진다","talkId":403810412,"textHash":"945222643593910988","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:6/talk-403810412","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"ea6e5e858273cb54","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"电视购物频道","bwikiRevision":95721,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8736","bwikiMission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-text-17444243861605717044-effect","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-6","missionId":"event-rogue-6","mission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","scene":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"전통프로젝트부의 품질 관리가 기준에 부합하는지 당신은 확인할 수 없다","talkId":null,"textHash":"17444243861605717044","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:6/text-17444243861605717044","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"4fe14d1234eb55dd","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810417-line"],"bwikiPage":"电视购物频道","bwikiRevision":95721,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8736","bwikiMission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810417-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-6","missionId":"event-rogue-6","mission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","scene":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"도넛을 먹으니 위에서 이상한 움직임이 느껴진다","talkId":403810417,"textHash":"6930435458543744258","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:6/talk-403810417","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"4fe14d1234eb55dd","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"电视购物频道","bwikiRevision":95721,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8736","bwikiMission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-text-7420577245166515203-effect","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-6","missionId":"event-rogue-6","mission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","scene":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"전통프로젝트부의 품질 관리가 기준에 부합하는지 당신은 확인할 수 없다","talkId":null,"textHash":"7420577245166515203","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:6/text-7420577245166515203","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"813f5546eda6de6f","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810418-line"],"bwikiPage":"电视购物频道","bwikiRevision":95721,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8736","bwikiMission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810418-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-6","missionId":"event-rogue-6","mission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","scene":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"연꽃이 노래를 부르자 어린 시절의 회상이 떠오르며 지난 시대로 돌아온 듯한 착각에 빠진다……","talkId":403810418,"textHash":"11103962844935667425","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:6/talk-403810418","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"813f5546eda6de6f","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"电视购物频道","bwikiRevision":95721,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8736","bwikiMission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-text-13819034689249780161-effect","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-6","missionId":"event-rogue-6","mission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","scene":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"전통프로젝트부의 품질 관리가 기준에 부합하는지 당신은 확인할 수 없다","talkId":null,"textHash":"13819034689249780161","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:6/text-13819034689249780161","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"021073320c61bf90","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810419-line"],"bwikiPage":"电视购物频道","bwikiRevision":95721,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8736","bwikiMission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810419-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-6","missionId":"event-rogue-6","mission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","scene":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"상자를 열어보자 안에 이상한 것이 들어 있는 듯하다……","talkId":403810419,"textHash":"13708956744852486448","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:6/talk-403810419","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"021073320c61bf90","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"电视购物频道","bwikiRevision":95721,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8736","bwikiMission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810420-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-6","missionId":"event-rogue-6","mission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","scene":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"홈쇼핑 프로그램에 빠져드는 것을 느낀다. 계속 보려 하는데 「치직」 소리를 내더니 화면이 꺼진다","talkId":403810420,"textHash":"2674039966178270685","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:6/talk-403810420","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"2b255312d10465d7","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"电视购物频道","bwikiRevision":95721,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8736","bwikiMission":"티비 홈쇼핑 채널"}],"orderNote":"공식 사건 도감에 귀속된 한국어 원문입니다. BWIKI에서 확인한 모드별 구간만 연결하며 조건·확률·미확인 경계는 이어 붙이지 않습니다.","bwikiBaseOrder":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810401-line","gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810402-line","gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810403-line","gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810408-line","gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810409-line","gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810410-line","gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810411-line","gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810412-line","gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-text-17444243861605717044-effect","gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810417-line","gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-text-7420577245166515203-effect","gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810418-line","gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-text-13819034689249780161-effect","gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810419-line","gold-and-gears-event-rogue-6-talk-403810420-line"],"bwiki":{"matchedRows":0,"cachedRows":15,"reviewRows":0,"segments":6,"reorderedRows":0},"retainedTextRowIds":[]}